Technically you are missing zilkai/selbri as well as whatever we want to
call ni abstractors (which are also functions), both of which are in the
apstrake category naturally. That said, interesting proposal, but I'm
uncertain that selsku is in the same category as the rest. It's subtle
because of the {se du'u} indirect discourse trick, but selsku seem to be by
themselves to me.

mi'e la latro'a mu'o


